BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 400.89 Td (8. Backend validates the SQL.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 389.39 Td (9. Backend executes the SQL with $1 = authenticated user id.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 377.89 Td (10. Backend redacts sensitive fields.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 366.39 Td (11. Backend calls ML service /assistant/answer.) Tj ET
