BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 383.39 Td (Agentic Action Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 354.39 Td (Agentic actions use a confirmation-first design.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 330.89 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 302.39 Td (User: Add 20 tablets to Metformin stock.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 290.89 Td (Assistant: Add 20 tablets to Metformin stock. Please confirm before I make this chan) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 279.39 Td (ge. Reply "yes" to continue or "cancel" to stop.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 267.89 Td (User: yes) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 256.39 Td (Assistant: Added 20 tablets to Metformin stock. Current stock is 45. I will take you) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 244.89 Td ( to the affected screen now.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 221.39 Td (Technical flow:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 192.89 Td (1. User sends an action-like command.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 181.39 Td (2. Backend parses it using deterministic rules.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 169.89 Td (3. Backend creates a pending action object.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 158.39 Td (4. Backend stores the pending action in assistant_messages.rows_returned.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 146.89 Td (5. Assistant asks for confirmation.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 135.39 Td (6. User replies yes or cancel.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 123.89 Td (7. Backend retrieves the latest pending action.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 112.39 Td (8. If cancelled, no database write happens.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 100.89 Td (9. If confirmed, backend executes the correct action handler.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 89.39 Td (10. Backend saves result metadata.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 77.89 Td (11. Frontend may navigate to the affected screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 10 of 16) Tj ET
endstream
