BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 710.89 Td (Flow:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 682.39 Td (1. Backend detects health advice intent.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 670.89 Td (2. Backend loads latest diabetes, stroke, or hypertension prediction.) Tj ET
