BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 647.89 Td (4. Backend retrieves trusted health advice chunks.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 636.39 Td (5. Backend sends prediction context and chunks to ML service.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 624.89 Td (6. ML service generates a short answer using only those chunks.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 613.39 Td (7. Backend stores the answer and source metadata.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 601.89 Td (8. Frontend displays the answer and trusted source names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 578.39 Td (This path supports:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 554.89 Td (- diabetes advice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 538.39 Td (- hypertension advice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 521.89 Td (- stroke advice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 498.39 Td (It intentionally refuses unsupported advice domains in this phase.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 465.89 Td (Emotional Support Integration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 436.89 Td (The assistant can also detect emotional-support messages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 413.39 Td (Examples:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 384.89 Td (I feel lonely today.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 373.39 Td (I feel confused and need support.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 361.89 Td (Has my mother seemed lonely recently?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 338.39 Td (The backend runs:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 309.89 Td (analyzeCheckIn\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 298.39 Td (  -> calculateRiskLevel\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 286.89 Td (  -> selectIntervention\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 275.39 Td (  -> getNextActivityByEmotion\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 263.89 Td (  -> createCheckInRecord\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 252.39 Td (  -> optionally create caregiver alerts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 228.89 Td (The assistant response can include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 205.39 Td (- detected emotion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 188.89 Td (- confidence) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 172.39 Td (- stress score) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 155.89 Td (- loneliness score) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 139.39 Td (- risk level) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 122.89 Td (- supportive chatbot reply) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 106.39 Td (- recommended cognitive activity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 89.89 Td (- caregiver alert creation status) Tj ET
