stream
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 776.89 Td (Voice Input and Voice Output) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 747.89 Td (Voice input:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 719.39 Td (User taps microphone) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 707.89 Td (  -> expo-speech-recognition requests permission) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 696.39 Td (  -> speech is transcribed) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 684.89 Td (  -> transcript fills the input) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 673.39 Td (  -> final transcript is sent as a chat message) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 649.89 Td (Voice output:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 621.39 Td (User taps Listen) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 609.89 Td (  -> expo-speech reads the assistant response aloud) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 598.39 Td (  -> user can stop playback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 574.89 Td (If speech recognition is not available in the app build, the assistant falls back to typed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 558.39 Td (input.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 525.89 Td (Caregiver Mode) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 496.89 Td (The assistant supports elder and caregiver roles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 473.39 Td (Caregiver mode changes phrasing and suggested prompts. For example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 444.89 Td (How is your mother doing today?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 433.39 Td (Which medicines are running low for your elder?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 421.89 Td (What should I monitor as a caregiver?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 398.39 Td (The important security point is that caregiver access still resolves to the elder's user id.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 381.89 Td (Queries still use:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 353.39 Td (WHERE user_id = $1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 329.89 Td (or the correct equivalent elder-scoped column such as:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 301.39 Td (WHERE elder_user_id = $1) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 268.89 Td (Fallback Handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 239.89 Td (The assistant has several fallback paths:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 216.39 Td (- Empty message returns a validation error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 199.89 Td (- Out-of-scope NL2SQL returns a polite limitation message.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 183.39 Td (- ML service unreachable returns an AI-unavailable message.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 166.89 Td (- SQL validation failure returns a safe refusal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 150.39 Td (- SQL execution failure returns a database-query failure message.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 133.89 Td (- Answer generation failure returns a simpler fallback based on whether rows were found.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 117.39 Td (- Missing agentic action details returns a request for more information.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 100.89 Td (- Failed confirmed action returns a specific explanation when possible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 77.39 Td (Fallback reasons are stored in assistant_messages.fallback_reason.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 14 of 16) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
