34 0 obj
<< /Length 2903 >>
stream
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 776.89 Td (Security Model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 747.89 Td (Security controls include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 724.39 Td (- JWT authentication on every assistant endpoint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 707.89 Td (- Authenticated userId is the only database scope parameter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 691.39 Td (- LLM-generated SQL is SELECT-only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 674.89 Td (- SQL is validated before execution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 658.39 Td (- User-scoped tables must include user scoping.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 641.89 Td (- Only allowed tables from schemaDescription.js can be queried.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 625.39 Td (- Only $1 parameter is allowed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 608.89 Td (- Database timeout is enforced.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 592.39 Td (- Row limits are enforced.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 575.89 Td (- Sensitive fields are redacted before answer generation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 559.39 Td (- Data-changing actions require explicit user confirmation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 542.89 Td (- Agentic writes are performed by backend code, not by LLM-generated SQL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 526.39 Td (- Chat requests are rate-limited per user.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 493.89 Td (Why This Design Is Appropriate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 464.89 Td (The system needs natural language flexibility, but it also handles sensitive healthcare) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 448.39 Td (records. The architecture therefore separates language intelligence from authority.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 424.89 Td (The LLM can:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 401.39 Td (- interpret user questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 384.89 Td (- generate candidate SQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 368.39 Td (- summarize retrieved records) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 351.89 Td (- produce friendly answers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 335.39 Td (- suggest follow-up questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 311.89 Td (The backend controls:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 288.39 Td (- authentication) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 271.89 Td (- database access) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 255.39 Td (- SQL validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 238.89 Td (- user scoping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 222.39 Td (- action parsing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 205.89 Td (- write execution) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 189.39 Td (- conversation persistence) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 172.89 Td (- fallback handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 149.39 Td (This gives the user a conversational experience while preserving strong control over data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 132.89 Td (access and modifications.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 100.39 Td (End-to-End Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 71.39 Td (The Unified Conversational Dashboard is an AI-assisted healthcare control layer built with) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 15 of 16) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
