BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 785.89 Td (React Native, Node/Express, PostgreSQL, FastAPI, spaCy, Ollama, and Llama 3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 762.39 Td (Its central function is to let users ask natural-language questions across the ElderMeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 745.89 Td (system and receive grounded answers based on their own records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 722.39 Td (Its agentic function is to safely perform selected app actions only after confirmation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 698.89 Td (The core technical pattern is:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 670.39 Td (Natural language) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 658.89 Td (  -> intent routing) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 647.39 Td (  -> safe retrieval or confirmed action) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 635.89 Td (  -> grounded conversational answer) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 624.39 Td (  -> persisted chat history) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 600.89 Td (This makes the dashboard unified because the same assistant interface can answer questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 584.39 Td (about medicines, adherence, stock, allergies, routines, mood, caregiver alerts, risk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 567.89 Td (predictions, and trusted health advice, while also safely completing selected user-approved) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 551.39 Td (tasks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 16 of 16) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
